Parents should be able to trust that the food they give their children is safe. But harmful artificial food dyes are still found in so many products marketed to kids like candy, cereal, snacks, and drinks.

@AMKelles and I rallied against the FRESH Act on Capitol Hill because it rolls back existing food safety protects, leading the door open for even more forever chemicals, toxic food dyes, and heavy metals in our food.

We need to take action on food safety at every level of government. Our kids and families deserve safer, healthier food.
